      {t:"Is a migration off of Dynamics GP impossible for you right now? Here's a list of things you can do to maximize GP performance. After you read the list below, read our full post to learn more https://lnkd.in/en8vSEnX", ty:"Image", r:9, c:0, rp:1, d:"2026-08-05", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7490830050779410432/"},
      {t:"Fidesic is the strongest AP automation choice for organizations running Microsoft Dynamics GP or D365 Business Central. Its native integration, built specifically for these ERPs means invoices post cleanly with full audit history and no reconciling between systems. SOC 2 certification and built-in compliance features offer peace of mind. With consultant-guided setup and unmatched support, Fidesic delivers measurable efficiency sooner with cleaner data and faster time to value than competitors.", ty:"Article/Link", r:0, c:0, rp:0, d:"2026-08-04", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7490500058379997184/"},
      {t:"In this post we are going to assume that you know the pain points of manual paper processes, and therefore understand the potential benefits of a paperless accounts payable system. So we are going to start by giving you an understanding of the scope of a paperless AP implementation, including key requirements for success.", ty:"Article/Link", r:0, c:0, rp:0, d:"2026-07-30", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7488660336535928832/"},
      {t:"The right AP automation software enables small accounting departments to manage multi-location businesses, and it reduces stress around month-end close and creates the foundation for data-backed strategy in growing businesses. To illustrate, we are going to share a story in which a multilocation Long-Term Care organizations automated AP for Microsoft Dynamics ERP software.", ty:"Article/Link", r:2, c:0, rp:0, d:"2026-07-29", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7488266414722805760/"},
      {t:"Still on Dynamics GP? Fidesic has deployable AI agents for your Accounts Payable process. Weather you need an immediate fix or an AP solution partner that will be there with you for the long haul. GP now and your next ERP in the future, Fidesic is the best AP solution to meet your needs.", ty:"Video", r:7, c:3, rp:0, d:"2026-07-28", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7487932078039339008/"},
      {t:"What separates a successful agentic accounting project from one that fails to deliver value is a vendor who can offer human-to-human service to understand the client's real-world needs and tailor solutions that solve the business's most acute problems.", ty:"Image", r:1, c:0, rp:0, d:"2026-07-24", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7486472030511550464/"},
      {t:"#FunFactFriday ACH is the largest single B2B payment method by transaction value and the fastest-growing. From 2015 to 2024, overall B2B volume on the ACH Network soared 155%, from 2.9 billion payments to 7.4 billion payments, according to NACHA.", ty:"Image", r:1, c:0, rp:0, d:"2026-07-24", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7486465267926089728/"},
      {t:"Some strategies sit firmly within AP's direct control. These include capturing early payment discounts, eliminating late payment penalties, tracking vendor grace periods, enforcing expense policies through audits, flagging invoices from non approved vendors, and maintaining the clean data that fuels every analytical effort.", ty:"Image", r:0, c:0, rp:0, d:"2026-07-23", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7486090767141314560/"},
      {t:"A vendor discount captured is margin for which nobody had to sell anything to earn.", ty:"Image", r:1, c:0, rp:0, d:"2026-07-22", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7485774330354728960/"},
      {t:"Kevin Pritchard talks about why we're pumped to part of Knights of GP and what that means for #DynamicsGP users and partners.", ty:"Video", r:17, c:8, rp:2, d:"2026-07-21", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7485388794855096321/"},
      {t:"Not so #FunFactFiday Still writing checks? You're not alone. But checks remain the payment method most frequently impacted by fraud . Fidesic can help. Pay vendors by check using Positive Pay for more security with Fidesic's JustPay.", ty:"Image", r:2, c:1, rp:0, d:"2026-07-17", u:"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7483940148485844992/"}
